                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Gameplay\nSo far from what I gather the game is straight forward. You are a home designer and get a set of objectives. How you complete these objectives give you a rating so pay close attention. You get rewards for completing objectives and generate an income as well which allows you to also purchase more property. The more property you have it also generates more gems which is the currency in game.\n\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1059964465\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1059963889\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1059963178\n\nOther thoughts?\nThe game seems to have loads to do and so far is fun. For me it is to early to say I love or hate it. I do LOVE the price so that alone is worth buying and testing it. \n\nAny early complaints? Well there already is one actually... The damn music. lol\nFML I heard this damn song for 118hrs in \"Castaway Paradise\" so im beyond tired of it.\n\nAnything stand out that you hope to see in the future?\nYes! Achievements please! That would give me more of a motivation to complete everything.\n\nWill update my review later after I given it a at least 30+hrs and got a few decent screenshots.",
